      "message": "Hi @michaelludwig@google.com, I updated `SkPDFDevice` to use bitmap layer fallback when the color space is not sRGB. I\u0027ve put up another CL (839476: pdf: Implement SkColorSpace on SaveLayerRec using ICC color profiles | https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/839476) attempting to implement the color space as a ICC color profile on the layer itself, but I\u0027ll need more guidance if we want to take that approach.",
